			Rearmed: The muster re-arms from the racks.
			RearmNone: No soldier has an Armory to draw from.
			LoadoutsReset: Reset {0} loadouts.
			LoadoutsResetOne: Reset 1 loadout.
			LoadoutsResetNone: No soldier has an Armory to draw from.
			ArmoryBroken: Armory destroyed. {0} items recovered.
			ArmoryBrokenOne: Armory destroyed. 1 item recovered.
			ArmoryBrokenEmpty: Armory destroyed. The racks were empty; your soldiers are carrying the gear.
			ArmoryNotEmpty: Empty the Armory first (Loot All) before you move it.
			LogisticalCenterInUse: Items are stored in the {0} slots this center provides. Sort the Armory or take them out first.
			GuideHint: Throw your junk in the Armory and the town will arm itself. A Field Manual, crafted from a little wood, has the whole story.
			RecruitingDrive: "{0} ran a recruiting drive: manpower restored for {1}."
			HazardPay: Hazard pay issued at {0}: {1}.
		}

